<title>HONG KONG: Cathay names Turnbull managing director.</title>
<headline>Cathay names Turnbull managing director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said on Friday it will apppoint David Turnbull as managing director, replacing Rod Eddington who will return to Australia and take up a position with News Ltd, and serve as executive chairman of Ansett Australia.  </p>
<p>Turnbull, currently deputy managing director of corporate development, will become managing director effective December 1, Cathay said.</p>
<p>Turnbull is also the chairman of Hong Kong Aircraft Engineering Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Cathay said Tony Tyler will assume the new position of director corporate development.</p>
<p>Robert Cutler will succeed Tyler as director service delivery from his position as general manager cargo.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
